{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"michael-david-simms","name":"Michael David Simms","birthDate":"","birthPlace":"","bio":"Michael David Simms is a Canadian actor and acting teacher based in Vancouver, BC. He is one of the few actors to have guest-starred on all three of the longest-running North American sci-fi series: The X-Files, Stargate SG-1, and Smallville. In film, he has appeared in What's Love Got to Do with It (1993), X2: X-Men United (2003), and Eight Below (2006). On television he had recurring roles on Millennium (1997) and The Outer Limits (1998–2001). He currently teaches acting through MDS Actors' Studio in Vancouver.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T18:03:11+00:00","tmdbId":116048,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/116048","credits":[{"id":"x2","title":"X2: X-Men United","character":"White House Agent (Lead Agent)"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/michael-david-simms.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Queens for a Day","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8YWoFjv2QdeUVogHvuneB8EuZ2V.jpg"},{"name":"Aurora Teagarden Mysteries: An Inheritance to Die For","year":2019,"character":"Victor Hanson","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nYkEw4fXfZnusQpR83k8GS8wBLH.jpg"},{"name":"The Good Doctor","year":2017,"character":"Flakey","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/luhKkdD80qe62fwop6sdrXK9jUT.jpg"},{"name":"Eight Below","year":2006,"character":"Armin Butler","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/39hR806Me4wI42LCFcK2LBiCRGW.jpg"},{"name":"Premonition","year":2005,"character":"Dr. Jamieson","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2Lo6USMKuPtoAzZwVqyKu5mgdMC.jpg"},{"name":"Santa's Slay","year":2005,"character":"Captain Caulk","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sdd0TRVpMjAViiBPq0oufYOHg0m.jpg"},{"name":"Chasing Freedom","year":2004,"character":"Judge","mediaType":"movie","poster":"